<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>true</ManagePackageVersionsCentrally>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageVersion Include="PhoenixmlDb.Xslt" Version="2.5.1" />
    <PackageVersion Include="YamlDotNet" Version="18.1.0" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <!--
      xunit.v3 4.x runs on Microsoft.Testing.Platform and nothing else. Three packages left
      with 3.2.2, all of them VSTest-only and now inert:

        Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk        the VSTest targets and test host
        xunit.runner.visualstudio     the VSTest adapter that discovered xunit tests
        coverlet.collector            a VSTest data collector, reached via the collect flag

      Removing them is not tidying. MTP 2.4.0 errors out of the VSTest target on the .NET 10
      SDK, so keeping the first two cannot work; and a collector that no longer collects is
      worse than an absent one, because the collect flag would still be accepted and quietly
      do nothing. Coverage under MTP comes from coverlet.mtp or from
      Microsoft.Testing.Extensions.CodeCoverage. Neither is added here, because nothing in
      this repo has ever asked for a coverage number. See docs/deferred-work.md.
    -->
    <PackageVersion Include="xunit.v3" Version="4.0.1" />
    <!-- Intentionally pinned. 7.x/8.x moved to the Xceed licence (paid for commercial
         use); 6.12.2 is the last MIT release, and docmd is a commercial product.
         Do not bump without a licensing decision. -->
    <PackageVersion Include="FluentAssertions" Version="6.12.2" />
    <!-- Test-only: differential oracle for the Markdown serialiser (Task 7). -->
    <PackageVersion Include="Markdig" Version="1.3.2" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
